        "id": 1380243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T15:57:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added a TODO, and I\u0027ll ask about a Rust interface to PermissionController.",
      "parentUuid": "306ee1e5_8b12933e",
      "revId": "c14ba104c8b0715ad70d507ee2023fbeea43d0fd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
