      "writtenOn": "2021-03-11T15:57:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently no, because this method also takes the opportunity to remove any VmInstance pointers which are no longer valid from the list.\n\nThough on further thought, it\u0027s probably sufficient to do that when `add_vm` is called, as that should still prevent the list growing indefinitely if VMs are created and destroyed regularly.",
